===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|manlich}}, from {{inh|de|goh|manlīh}}, {{m|goh|manalīh}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*mannlīk}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*mannlīkaz}}. {{surf|de|Mann|lich}}. Cognates include {{cog|nl|mannelijk}}, {{cog|en|manly}}, and {{cog|non|mannligr|t=human}} (whence {{cog|da|mandlig}}, {{cog|sv|manlig}}).

